# Database Schema

## Entities

### User
- uid: string (PK)
- email: string (Unique)
- password: string
- displayName: string
- role: 'admin' | 'teacher'
- subject: string (optional)

### Schedule
- id: integer (PK, AI)
- subject: string
- date: string
- startTime: string
- endTime: string
- room: string
- teacherId: string (FK)
- teacherName: string
- classGroup: string
- status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'absent' | 'vaga'

### Lab
- id: string (PK)
- name: string

### LabBooking
- id: integer (PK, AI)
- labId: string (FK)
- teacherId: string (FK)
- teacherName: string
- date: string
- startTime: string
- endTime: string

### Certificate
- id: integer (PK, AI)
- teacherId: string (FK)
- teacherName: string
- date: string
- reason: string
- imageUrl: string (Base64 or path)
- status: 'pending' | 'approved'
- createdAt: timestamp
